igh schoolers in Stockton  have published a feature article on a  fellow student who works in the porn  industry the story in the school paper  the Bruin voice described how Caitlyn  fink considered her adult entertainment  career as a job just like any other job  as I'm sure everyone now sees the  content is not obscene in any way and  it's merely just showing the story of a  young student at our school who is on  her own living her independent life and  having to navigate the world of the  pornography industry and I feel though  that's an important story to tell and so  far the school has backed off its thread  to fire Kathy Duffy I am still employed  yes I think it's always a question she  receives support after national news  coverage of the showdown but most  important to her is the reaction of her  students she  such an inspiration and a role model to  everyone at school not just our class  and I'm glad that she's still here and  what is there inside of you that gave  you this kind of gumption I think  because this is not my first rodeo with  the district I have had some pretty  knock-down drag-out fights over the  years they've been hurtful and so I  still have something to prove I think to  this district that even after 33 years  me putting my job on the line means that  I am serious about free speech and I  will always hold them accountable  so our shout-out tonight to Cathy duffel  like many of us in this profession my  own career was launched at a high school  newspaper in Highland Park Illinois the  shoreline to this day I remember and  unthankful from all I learned my  journalism teacher dr. John muttski  that's our program for tonight thanks  for watching we'll see you back here and  next week
 

